# Data licensing

This repository mixes original work with data derived from third-party platforms.
The MIT license in `LICENSE` covers only the former. This file states what applies
to each data file.

## MIT licensed (original work)

The following were assembled and verified by hand from Etherscan, protocol
documentation, and published incident post-mortems. They are original work and fall
under `LICENSE`:

- `data/ground_truth/anchor_contracts.csv`
- `data/ground_truth/function_signatures.csv`
- `data/ground_truth/flash_loan_attacks_v2.csv`
- `data/ground_truth/lookup_results.csv`

The underlying facts — contract addresses, function selectors, transaction hashes —
are public Ethereum state and are not owned by anyone. What is licensed here is the
selection, verification, and annotation.

